FileCat.SharpCompress.dll
=========================

FileCat's build of SharpCompress 0.50.5 (https://github.com/adamhathcock/sharpcompress, commit
e4193af83b6ec8bdd5fb4f6ebffc2315dd3fc626), without SharpCompress's RAR support. FileCat changed the
source; src/ThirdParty/SharpCompress/THIRD-PARTY-CHANGES.md in FileCat's source repository lists every
change. SharpCompress: Copyright (c) 2014 Adam Hathcock, MIT License (LICENSE.txt).

Parts of it come from other projects and keep their own licenses. COMPONENTS.md names the files of each
part. This file gathers the notices those licenses ask a binary distribution to carry: the attribution
notices of the Apache License 2.0 parts (its section 4) and the copyright and license notices of the
others. The full license texts are Apache-2.0.txt, MS-PL.txt and the files in upstream/.


